Third-party files in Media/ keep their own licences (full texts beside them):

- Media/Fonts/Manrope-*.ttf: Manrope, SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (Media/Fonts/OFL-Manrope.txt). Static weights cut from the variable font.
- Media/Fonts/IBMPlexMono-*.ttf: IBM Plex Mono, SIL Open Font License 1.1 with
  Reserved Font Name "Plex" (Media/Fonts/OFL-IBMPlexMono.txt). Unmodified.
- Media/Icons/*.tga (except the tally marks): Tabler Icons, MIT
  (Media/Icons/LICENSE-Tabler.txt). Rasterized to TGA.
